### Balance of a known account.
### Replace {{accountId}} in http-client.env.json with an account printed by
### `make kafka-produce-scenario TOPIC=transacoes-financeiras-processadas`.
GET {{host}}/balances/{{accountId}}
Accept: application/json

### Malformed identifier — expects 400 with application/problem+json.
GET {{host}}/balances/not-a-uuid
Accept: application/json

### Well-formed identifier that was never seen — expects 404.
GET {{host}}/balances/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Liveness and readiness probes.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Business metrics, including balance.transactions.processed by outcome.
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
